 class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Exquisite Gift Of Eggness</b> was a limited Easter event item available at the in game Easter shop for $65,780.\n</p><p>You could buy it in the new Easter shack, Eggcelent Deals, and it left the game on May 14th.\n</p><p>Once unboxed, it gives the item \"Fancy Eg\", which is a white egg with a top hat, monocle, the \"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/catalog/20722130/Shiny-Teeth\">Shiny Teeth</a>\" face and 2 legs with 3 pivot points each.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>Swinging his legs.\n</p><p>this eg is a refferance to the game eg (no way)\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902200202\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 60/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019483/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.630      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   38.630      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2727-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902200202 and revision id 15286. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Eggcelent Deals","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true}],"images":["ExquisiteGiftOfEggness.png","Fancy_Eg.png"]}
